BEHAVIOR read-file-all

DESCRIPTION
  Reads an entire file (up to 65536 bytes) into data, with its byte count.
  Convenience wiring over open/read/close.

CONTRACT
  INPUT path string
  OUTPUT data bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  REQUIRES open@7d62cd96 read@82ce10f8 close@d4ba30e5 copy@05c62b49
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH bf59f1e1

COMPOSITION
  inf = CALL open path 0
  rd = CALL read inf.fd 65536
  cp = CALL copy rd.buffer 0 data 0 rd.bytes_read
  DISCARD cp.bytes_copied
  cl = CALL close inf.fd
  DISCARD cl.status
  SET length rd.bytes_read
END
